WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:07.383
What?

2
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.769
Pi... Pi Han-wool?

3
00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:10.530
Yes.

4
00:00:10.531 --> 00:00:13.192
- How did you know, retard? - Why are you calling me a retard, brainless?

5
00:00:13.193 --> 00:00:15.059
Of course I call a retard a retard, what else should I call you?

6
00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:19.709
Ah, it seems Teacher Han-kyung doesn't know yet.

7
00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:22.456
Please, absolutely do not try to find out about that kid.

8
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.449
Otherwise, you might die.

9
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.079
- What? - That is to say,

10
00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.609
The "die" here is not a metaphor.

11
00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.869
It means literally exactly that.

12
00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.040
Be careful.

13
00:01:04.520 --> 00:01:05.820
Why did you call me here?

14
00:01:09.186 --> 00:01:10.820
(3rd Period: English - Singular Form)

15
00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:11.855
(National Language. 3rd Period: English - Singular Form. Math.)

16
00:01:18.628 --> 00:01:20.830
(Those who want to study, gather around!)

17
00:01:20.831 --> 00:01:22.999
(Hwang Min-hyun)

18
00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:25.267
(Han Ji-eun)

19
00:01:25.268 --> 00:01:26.570
(Cha Woo-min)

20
00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:37.913
(Lee Jong-hyun)

21
00:01:37.914 --> 00:01:39.182
(Shin Soo-hyun)

22
00:01:40.083 --> 00:01:42.519
(Yoon Sang-jeong, Gong Do-yu)

23
00:01:47.891 --> 00:01:52.629
"Study Group"

24
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:06.369
It's here, right?

25
00:02:06.370 --> 00:02:06.916
Right.

26
00:02:06.917 --> 00:02:08.129
Seriously.

27
00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:09.046
I told you it is.

28
00:02:15.910 --> 00:02:17.269
How about you go?

29
00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:18.669
Of course you have to go.

30
00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:20.129
No need, you can go too.

31
00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:22.620
No need, hurry up before she changes her mind.

32
00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:23.880
True.

33
00:02:23.881 --> 00:02:25.423
Before she changes her mind.

34
00:02:27.516 --> 00:02:29.069
But what was her name again?

35
00:02:29.070 --> 00:02:31.100
Ji-woo. Lee Ji-woo.

36
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:50.516
What... what are you doing?

37
00:02:51.966 --> 00:02:53.429
I don't know what Lee Ji-woo looks like.

38
00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.646
Just ask.

39
00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.369
- Ah... - Ah, fine, hurry up and go in.

40
00:02:57.370 --> 00:02:59.249
Wait, wait, just wait a second.

41
00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.239
Enough, just go in.

42
00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.376
Hey, Lee Ji-woo!

43
00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.230
Nice.

44
00:03:04.690 --> 00:03:05.800
Someone called her.

45
00:03:10.143 --> 00:03:13.976
- Ah... - Hey, give up on Lee Ji-woo.

46
00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:15.366
Why?

47
00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.480
She's Lee Hyun-woo's twin sister.

48
00:03:21.013 --> 00:03:21.956
Go to hell.

49
00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:25.553
There's no way someone like that would apply to join a study group.

50
00:03:26.957 --> 00:03:29.229
This crazy woman sure is bold.

51
00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:33.709
Didn't I tell you to put the cafeteria menu on my desk?

52
00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.179
Why do you treat my words like passing wind and ruin the mood?

53
00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:37.766
What's your problem?

54
00:03:42.100 --> 00:03:43.030
What is this?

55
00:03:43.726 --> 00:03:45.335
You printed the menu but didn't put it on my desk?

56
00:03:45.336 --> 00:03:46.570
No, um...

57
00:03:49.586 --> 00:03:51.813
A midterm exam prep plan?

58
00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:56.540
What's wrong with you two brats?

59
00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:58.826
Damn it.

60
00:03:59.273 --> 00:04:01.946
What the f*** are you glaring at, bitch?

61
00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:06.230
I think I said the only one you can hit is me.

62
00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.206
Aren't you going to let go?

63
00:04:10.426 --> 00:04:11.176
Let go.

64
00:04:11.576 --> 00:04:13.460
Let go, you bitch.

65
00:04:14.206 --> 00:04:15.186
Let go.

66
00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:17.710
Let go, you f***ing bitch.

67
00:04:18.793 --> 00:04:20.869
F***, I'm so pissed.

68
00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.703
Hey.

69
00:04:22.696 --> 00:04:25.029
If you don't put the menu on my desk before the next class,

70
00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.650
you're dead.

71
00:04:30.186 --> 00:04:32.259
(Midterm Exam Prep Plan)

72
00:04:32.260 --> 00:04:34.456
You're just a couple of brats, what are you studying for?

73
00:04:41.373 --> 00:04:43.160
Huh? What's up with him?

74
00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:45.589
When did he get there?

75
00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.463
What's your deal?

76
00:04:46.464 --> 00:04:48.609
Wow, this is really well organized.

77
00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:49.689
Who are you?

78
00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:52.300
So you use a highlighter to mark each subject.

79
00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:55.506
I should try doing this too.

80
00:04:55.507 --> 00:04:57.570
What the hell are you doing, you idiot?

81
00:04:59.126 --> 00:05:01.339
What's happening? Why is it so noisy?

82
00:05:01.340 --> 00:05:03.109
Kyu-jin bro.

83
00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.476
It's nothing...

84
00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:08.126
Our Mi-hee is prettiest when she keeps her mouth shut.

85
00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:14.200
You're that Yoon Jiamin who beat up Lee Hyun-woo.

86
00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.113
But,

87
00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:18.966
what are you doing with my girlfriend?

88
00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:22.653
Oh, your girlfriend?

89
00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:25.050
- I had something to ask her. - Right.

90
00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.256
I mean my girlfriend.

91
00:05:34.706 --> 00:05:35.756
I'm sorry.

92
00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.910
- Let's go. - Why?

93
00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:40.259
- Our study group... - Ah, don't...

94
00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:42.006
- Hurry up and let's go. - Why?

95
00:05:45.546 --> 00:05:47.653
Did our Ji-woo talk to another man?

96
00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:49.366
Then she needs a beating.

97
00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:51.239
- Hold out your hand. - Get lost.

98
00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:51.986
What?

99
00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.129
Is it because you feel embarrassed in front of everyone?

100
00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:55.190
Psycho.

101
00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.956
I clearly told you not to stand out.

102
00:06:04.606 --> 00:06:06.810
Our Ji-woo will just take 3 hits, okay?

103
00:06:07.853 --> 00:06:08.706
Or,

104
00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:10.486
do you want to act cute for me?

105
00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:12.130
Then I'll let you off.

106
00:06:16.756 --> 00:06:17.983
Just hit me.

107
00:06:28.666 --> 00:06:29.620
Gum?

108
00:06:34.886 --> 00:06:36.063
Didn't you say she's your girlfriend?

109
00:06:44.243 --> 00:06:45.989
You insolent punk.

110
00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:48.126
You think you're a big deal just because you beat Lee Hyun-woo?

111
00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.697
If you don't use a breakfall, your neck will snap.

112
00:06:55.698 --> 00:06:57.799
Hey, you punk, Kim Kyu-jin.

113
00:06:57.800 --> 00:06:58.686
What are you doing?

114
00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:01.213
Didn't you hear the broadcast calling the student council to gather?

115
00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:03.976
Get over here, what are you doing?

116
00:07:14.513 --> 00:07:16.653
We'll meet again soon, freshman.

117
00:07:38.223 --> 00:07:40.970
Hey, do you have any intention of living a quiet school life?

118
00:07:41.840 --> 00:07:42.686
Of course I do.

119
00:07:42.687 --> 00:07:44.989
Who throws gum in the face of a student council member?

120
00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.319
Are you crazy?

121
00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.019
I didn't know he was in the student council.

122
00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.929
Don't they stand at the school gate every morning?

123
00:07:49.930 --> 00:07:50.990
You didn't know that?

124
00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:53.159
Besides,

125
00:07:53.160 --> 00:07:56.420
I couldn't just stand by and watch a member of our study group get hit.

126
00:07:57.556 --> 00:07:59.249
Is it confirmed?

127
00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.153
Yeah.

128
00:08:04.243 --> 00:08:06.419
Sigh, I don't know anymore. Anyway,

129
00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:07.529
you're doomed.

130
00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:08.599
Because you messed with the student council,

131
00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.360
your school life is going to be exhausting from now on.

132
00:08:24.253 --> 00:08:30.773
I was the one who used Ji-woo's name to apply for the study group.

133
00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:31.886
Why?

134
00:08:31.886 --> 00:08:32.880
Well,

135
00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:37.009
Because Ji-woo is being bullied.

136
00:08:37.010 --> 00:08:39.836
Hey, don't you think Kyu-jin bro is super handsome?

137
00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.119
Damn, totally my type.

138
00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:43.469
Handsome my foot.

139
00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:44.979
He looks exactly like the General MacArthur statue

140
00:08:44.980 --> 00:08:46.500
in the park.

141
00:08:50.856 --> 00:08:53.929
Just like that, within a week of coming to this school,

142
00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.270
I became a target.

143
00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:00.386
I'll return it to you right away.

144
00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:04.400
Hey, what are we doing?

145
00:09:04.401 --> 00:09:05.559
Let's go to karaoke, karaoke.

146
00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.646
Karaoke?

147
00:09:09.393 --> 00:09:10.816
F***, won't you let go?

148
00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:18.069
It f***ing hurts, damn it, seriously.

149
00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.456
Hey, Lee Ji-woo!

150
00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:24.129
Did you ask if Ji-woo is getting bullied because she defended me?

151
00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:24.956
What?

152
00:09:30.023 --> 00:09:32.216
We haven't asked that yet.

153
00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.039
Then can you ask me?

154
00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:34.846
Okay.

155
00:09:35.930 --> 00:09:38.890
So, is Ji-woo being bullied because she defended you?

156
00:09:39.573 --> 00:09:40.550
No.

157
00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.626
That's unexpected, right?

158
00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.709
Yeah...

159
00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:51.009
Nobody dares to mess with Ji-woo casually.

160
00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.100
Thanks to her, I'm no longer bullied either.

161
00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:02.843
Is that it?

162
00:10:03.956 --> 00:10:05.439
Not long after,

163
00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.083
something happened.

164
00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:18.129
I don't know the exact details,

165
00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.189
but Ji-woo's younger brother, Hyun-woo,

166
00:10:20.190 --> 00:10:24.079
was doing a delivery job for some important items at the time,

167
00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.613
and probably had an accident.

168
00:10:26.606 --> 00:10:27.803
Do you want me to lend you some money?

169
00:10:33.546 --> 00:10:34.380
Yes.

170
00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:35.670
Sure.

171
00:10:36.726 --> 00:10:37.530
But...

172
00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:52.136
OK.

173
00:10:59.606 --> 00:11:04.126
Kim Kyu-jin started using that video of Hyun-woo to blackmail Ji-woo.

174
00:11:05.753 --> 00:11:07.529
Normally, when it came to her brother,

175
00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:09.549
Ji-woo would grind her teeth in anger.

176
00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:11.179
But the sad thing is,

177
00:11:11.180 --> 00:11:13.366
he is, after all, her only family.

178
00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:30.030
The bullying started around that time too.

179
00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:38.585
I've always only received help from Ji-woo.

180
00:11:38.586 --> 00:11:42.339
So this time, I want to help out too.

181
00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.519
Before I transfer schools.

182
00:11:44.080 --> 00:11:45.566
- Transfer? - Yes.

183
00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.019
I haven't told Ji-woo yet.

184
00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:53.300
Because of my dad's job, I have to move.

185
00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:58.920
So even though it's shameless of me, I want to ask you for a favor this once.

186
00:12:01.056 --> 00:12:02.853
Help me delete that video.

187
00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.510
And from now on,

188
00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:09.516
please accompany Ji-woo to study in my place.

189
00:12:11.816 --> 00:12:13.010
Can you do it?

190
00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.823
Didn't you say school life is already tiring enough?

191
00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.900
What? Why are you pushing this onto me at a time like this?

192
00:12:20.430 --> 00:12:21.466
Well...

193
00:12:25.493 --> 00:12:26.493
Please.

194
00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.650
Please.

195
00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.049
Alright, even if school life is exhausting...

196
00:12:41.050 --> 00:12:43.199
- Sure. - Sure.

197
00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:44.080
Let's help Ji-woo.

198
00:12:44.081 --> 00:12:46.229
So she can come to school and focus solely on studying.

199
00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:47.876
- Really? - Yeah.

200
00:12:50.403 --> 00:12:52.916
But, where is that video?

201
00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.229
But what kind of video is it exactly

202
00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.859
that makes Lee Ji-woo too afraid to even move?

203
00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.969
Hey, if it's enough to make Lee Ji-woo bow her head,

204
00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:03.132
it must be something huge.

205
00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:04.903
Is it this?

206
00:13:04.904 --> 00:13:06.020
Let me see.

207
00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.250
What is it? Let me see...

208
00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:10.970
That's it.

209
00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:12.859
I've seen him flash it in front of Lee Ji-woo a few times.

210
00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:14.500
Hurry up and play it.

211
00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:19.519
- Hurry up and play it. - Just wait a second.

212
00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:20.982
Just what is it that makes her like this?

213
00:13:20.983 --> 00:13:22.118
(Lee Ji-woo)

214
00:13:29.473 --> 00:13:30.720
Look at you guys.

215
00:13:35.733 --> 00:13:37.173
The student council office is a no-go.

216
00:13:38.110 --> 00:13:39.053
Why?

217
00:13:40.063 --> 00:13:42.109
Because it's the student council office, of course it's a no-go.

218
00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:43.100
That's why I'm asking why.

219
00:13:43.860 --> 00:13:44.933
Right?

220
00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:47.620
That student council office is a bit...

221
00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:49.073
difficult, right?

222
00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.213
Why?

223
00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:55.883
Because the student council

224
00:13:56.630 --> 00:13:58.743
is a school-officially-sanctioned gangster group.

225
00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.590
"School officially sanctioned gangster group."

226
00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:03.999
They suppress those mid-level delinquents,

227
00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:07.059
and in exchange, gain the power to commit misdeeds openly.

228
00:14:07.060 --> 00:14:08.559
So ordinary students

229
00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:10.860
don't even dare step foot near the student council office.

230
00:14:11.510 --> 00:14:13.279
You punk, damn it.

231
00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:14.700
Are you guys really that curious?

232
00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:16.430
Want to see?

233
00:14:16.431 --> 00:14:17.610
No, well...

234
00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:19.959
Although I kind of want to see it.

235
00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.675
- Watch it. - Really?

236
00:14:21.676 --> 00:14:23.609
See it with your own eyes, punk.

237
00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:25.209
Because I'm going to upload it to GoTube.

238
00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.359
"GoTube"?

239
00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.349
Didn't you promise not to leak it?

240
00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:31.429
Hey, you borrowed money from those nerds, why aren't you paying it back?

241
00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.193
F***, why should I pay them back?

242
00:14:33.690 --> 00:14:34.939
Right?

243
00:14:34.940 --> 00:14:37.719
Only the weak obediently keep their promises.

244
00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.393
Also, use your brains, you punks.

245
00:14:40.029 --> 00:14:42.140
If even her only family member goes to juvie,

246
00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.576
how heartbroken would our Ji-woo be?

247
00:14:45.166 --> 00:14:48.219
Are you planning to swoop in when she has a mental breakdown?

248
00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.139
The only person she'll be able to rely on is her boyfriend!

249
00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:51.993
Besides, the money I lent out wasn't mine anyway.

250
00:14:52.633 --> 00:14:53.456
Then whose is it?

251
00:14:53.923 --> 00:14:55.036
It was his own money!

252
00:14:56.036 --> 00:14:57.190
What do you mean by that?

253
00:14:58.540 --> 00:14:59.770
It's exactly what it sounds like.

254
00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.383
Honestly, no matter how much I think about it, Han-wool is a genius.

255
00:15:15.756 --> 00:15:17.829
Why did you come to ask me where Hyun-woo is?

256
00:15:17.830 --> 00:15:20.599
Because I heard you're close to Hyun-woo.

257
00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:21.606
I'm not.

258
00:15:22.736 --> 00:15:24.470
I'm not close to anyone.

259
00:15:25.830 --> 00:15:26.442
Right.

260
00:15:26.443 --> 00:15:29.166
I heard he borrowed money from Kim Kyu-jin but didn't pay it back.

261
00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:30.890
Is that why he ran away?

262
00:15:30.891 --> 00:15:32.869
He only borrowed that money because of you.

263
00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.996
Because of me?

264
00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:36.539
Who said that?

265
00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:39.469
He got into an accident while running an errand to deliver money for you!

266
00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:40.762
And that's how it turned out, isn't it?

267
00:15:40.763 --> 00:15:42.279
Then what do I get out of it?

268
00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:43.579
As long as you give the order,

269
