537
00:36:31.060 --> 00:36:33.069
if Pi Han-wool was arrested immediately,

538
00:36:33.070 --> 00:36:35.613
he'll go to juvie just like Lee Hyun-woo...

539
00:36:41.593 --> 00:36:42.460
Hey.

540
00:36:42.461 --> 00:36:43.519
Of course he has to go.

541
00:36:43.520 --> 00:36:45.046
Those brats.

542
00:36:45.950 --> 00:36:47.599
But that guy Pi Han-wool,

543
00:36:47.600 --> 00:36:49.186
came to school today too.

544
00:36:59.317 --> 00:37:00.260
What the?

545
00:37:00.260 --> 00:37:01.226
What's going on?

546
00:37:06.006 --> 00:37:07.416
Yoon Jiamin.

547
00:37:07.900 --> 00:37:09.636
Come down right now.

548
00:37:13.520 --> 00:37:14.379
Why?

549
00:37:14.380 --> 00:37:15.290
Are you seriously asking why?

550
00:37:15.880 --> 00:37:17.359
"Why?" F***.

551
00:37:17.360 --> 00:37:18.559
He's actually asking why. What should I do with him?

552
00:37:18.560 --> 00:37:21.123
Damn, I knew this would happen.

553
00:37:21.960 --> 00:37:22.850
What?

554
00:37:23.820 --> 00:37:25.729
Even though you might not care,

555
00:37:25.730 --> 00:37:27.859
everyone in Meteor Vocational High School is focusing on you right now.

556
00:37:27.860 --> 00:37:28.910
Yoon Jiamin.

557
00:37:32.930 --> 00:37:34.203
(Meteor Vocational High School Student Council) Kyu-jin, what happened to you?

558
00:37:34.780 --> 00:37:37.189
Are you okay? Who did this to you?

559
00:37:37.190 --> 00:37:38.789
Was it Yoon Jiamin again?

560
00:37:38.790 --> 00:37:41.343
That guy Yoon Jiamin really is...

561
00:37:42.190 --> 00:37:43.000
Hey.

562
00:37:43.001 --> 00:37:44.629
I heard Yoon Jiamin also beat the crap out of Kim Kyu-jin this time.

563
00:37:44.630 --> 00:37:45.433
Really?

564
00:37:45.434 --> 00:37:46.849
Kim Kyu-jin?

565
00:37:46.850 --> 00:37:49.119
The student council member with a judo background?

566
00:37:49.120 --> 00:37:51.289
Hey, but isn't Kim Kyu-jin a second-year?

567
00:37:51.290 --> 00:37:54.103
That demon just leapfrogged right into the second year.

568
00:37:55.690 --> 00:37:57.690
Then what will happen to Kang Tae-oh?

569
00:37:59.680 --> 00:38:00.909
What are those guys talking about?

570
00:38:00.910 --> 00:38:03.259
No matter how messy Meteor Vocational High School is,

571
00:38:03.260 --> 00:38:06.219
there's an unspoken rule against competing for ranks between grades.

572
00:38:06.220 --> 00:38:08.089
But you broke that unspoken rule.

573
00:38:08.090 --> 00:38:08.880
He looks scared out of his mind.

574
00:38:08.881 --> 00:38:11.099
He's too scared to do anything now, isn't he?

575
00:38:11.100 --> 00:38:12.016
So I ask,

576
00:38:12.713 --> 00:38:13.886
who is he?

577
00:38:18.303 --> 00:38:19.389
(1st Year Rank 1: Kang Tae-oh) Kang Tae-oh.

578
00:38:19.390 --> 00:38:20.780
1st Year Rank 1.

579
00:38:21.956 --> 00:38:24.119
F***, I told you to come down!

580
00:38:24.120 --> 00:38:26.299
Let's decide who's the real boss!

581
00:38:26.300 --> 00:38:27.496
Come on!

582
00:38:28.420 --> 00:38:29.833
You can just be the boss.

583
00:38:31.616 --> 00:38:32.879
Hey, did you guys see that?

584
00:38:32.880 --> 00:38:34.536
That kid running away with his tail between his legs!

585
00:38:36.983 --> 00:38:37.790
What?

586
00:38:38.580 --> 00:38:39.809
Was he...

587
00:38:39.810 --> 00:38:41.323
looking down on me?

588
00:38:41.690 --> 00:38:42.889
Yes, exactly!

589
00:38:42.890 --> 00:38:44.132
Tae-oh, he's looking down on you!

590
00:38:44.133 --> 00:38:45.469
Not just looking down on you, he's despising you!

591
00:38:45.470 --> 00:38:47.249
Not just despising you, he's treating you like you don't exist!

592
00:38:47.250 --> 00:38:48.863
Treating me like I don't exist...

593
00:38:49.890 --> 00:38:51.850
Hey, you punk!

594
00:38:53.650 --> 00:38:54.799
How dare you look down on me!

595
00:38:54.800 --> 00:38:56.869
Yoon Jiamin, you're not going to come down?

596
00:38:56.870 --> 00:38:58.396
Where did Joon go?

597
00:38:58.886 --> 00:39:01.150
Let me go, you trash!

598
00:39:02.530 --> 00:39:04.906
You punk, you're here.

599
00:39:05.410 --> 00:39:06.636
What is this now?

600
00:39:07.328 --> 00:39:10.469
Stop moving around, punk!

601
00:39:10.470 --> 00:39:14.199
This kid was acting all arrogant saying he was going to conquer Meteor Vocational High School.

602
00:39:14.200 --> 00:39:17.089
I thought he had some spirit.

603
00:39:17.090 --> 00:39:19.909
Turns out he was holding something disgusting.

604
00:39:19.910 --> 00:39:20.571
(Study Group Member Application Form) What is this?

605
00:39:20.572 --> 00:39:21.253
(Mechanics Dept. 1st Year, No. 27 Lee Joon) (Future Activity Plan: Conquer Meteor Vocational High School)

606
00:39:21.254 --> 00:39:23.239
Study group membership application form!

607
00:39:23.240 --> 00:39:24.643
Study group?

608
00:39:25.563 --> 00:39:26.460
I'm going crazy.

609
00:39:27.120 --> 00:39:29.255
Yoon Jiamin, it's all your fault for planting weird ideas in his head!

610
00:39:29.256 --> 00:39:31.973
You've turned him into a real idiot!

611
00:39:32.490 --> 00:39:33.623
Hand that over.

612
00:39:34.470 --> 00:39:35.200
This?

613
00:39:37.640 --> 00:39:38.810
You punk.

614
00:39:45.573 --> 00:39:47.669
Cute little guy.

615
00:39:47.670 --> 00:39:51.169
From now on, anyone holding this piece of paper will die by my hands.

616
00:39:51.170 --> 00:39:52.166
Got it?

617
00:39:57.466 --> 00:39:58.430
What is he doing?

618
00:40:08.576 --> 00:40:09.676
Yoon Jiamin.

619
00:40:15.990 --> 00:40:18.013
F***.

620
00:40:57.939 --> 00:41:01.976
"Study Group"

621
00:42:08.042 --> 00:42:16.384
